      registrations, so the section 11 justification is n/a.
      Deploy order: SPA first, or together with the BFF. Full record:
      notes/task-157-external-grid-columns.md.
    </outcome>
    <outcome date="2026-10-02" branch="task/uac-r2-157-r1" round="review-1">
      Status corrected from "completed" to "completed-with-escalation". Code is complete and tested. Two items stay
      open: the MANUAL live gate (criterion 6, pending by design, deploy order in note section 5), and an owner
      decision on finding F1.
      Item 8/15 (guard failed open, criterion 1): ExternalSpaGridViewSelectorGuardTests was rewritten to fail closed.
      Every import of DataGrid or DataGridDefault from the shared lib is now a mount source. That covers named,
